  "releaseNotes": "New package XUnitAssured.Camunda: deploy BPMN, start real Camunda 8.10 process instances on a shared cluster and mock the diagram's job workers per instance, with assertions that wait for the cluster. The other packages are unchanged from 6.19.1. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
